 to adapt to survive and thrive! <br><br></li><li> Battle against fearsome Bosses - Each Island has its own particular boss stage, where the player will test their might against one of the mighty Dragons and their horde of Darklings to free the Islands of their cursed fates. <br><br></li><li> Unlock achievements and collect rewards - Perform great feats to unlock achievements, and acquire bonus coins as a reward for your efforts!</li></ul>",
